     nominalisations/1000w    12.2
FLAG "rather than"/instead-of/10,000w  243.9   (warn >25; not epanorthosis, no published baseline)
FLAG sentences ending on a cross-ref/citation/hedge (wasted stress position): 3
       > …Clearly the first result matters (Section 3).
       > …Prior work agrees [1, 2].
       > … full suite of papers, which suggests the method might hold generally.
ok   sentences whose main claim is a negation: 22%
